      "writtenOn": "2025-12-03T17:07:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the external code signaling Dawn\u0027s fence would lead to undefined behaviors. Right now, Dawn assumes that only it signals its own fence with incremental values.\nLet\u0027s say Dawn signaled value `N`, then external code signaled `N+2`, or even `N+1`. then in the next Submit, Dawn attempted to signal the value `N+1`, this would result in no-op because the fence already passes `N+1`",
      "parentUuid": "460596c9_fff7c497",
